  "solution": {
    "text": "Let here be 1M each of H<sub>2</sub> and I<sub>2</sub><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>⇌</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math><br />1&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 0<br />(1-0.8)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(1-0.8)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.8</mn></math><br />=0.2&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; =0.2&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; =1.6<br /><math> <mrow>  <msub>   <mtext>K</mtext>   <mtext>c</mtext>  </msub>  <mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>=</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mfrac>   <mrow>    <msup>     <mrow>      <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\">       <mrow>        <mtext>HI</mtext></mrow>      </mfenced></mrow>     <mtext>2</mtext>    </msup>    </mrow>   <mrow>    <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\">     <mrow>      <msub>       <mtext>H</mtext>       <mtext>2</mtext>      </msub>      </mrow>    </mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\">     <mrow>      <msub>       <mtext>I</mtext>       <mtext>2</mtext>      </msub>      </mrow>    </mfenced></mrow>  </mfrac>  </mrow></math><br /><math> <mrow>  <mtext>&#x00A0;=</mtext><mfrac>   <mrow>    <mn>1.6</mn><mo>&#x00D7;</mo><mn>1.6</mn></mrow>   <mrow>    <mn>0.2</mn><mo>&#x00D7;</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow>  </mfrac>  </mrow></math><br /><math> <mrow>  <msub>   <mtext>K</mtext>   <mtext>c</mtext>  </msub>  <mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>=</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>64</mtext></mrow></math>"
